[ti:Are we still here?]
[al:Bringing the world back]

[00:02.59]Everybody's moving
[00:07.12]Nobody's going anywhere
[00:12.81]Are we still here?
[00:31.67]I walked into a room today, uh
[00:33.97]A hundred eyes, a thousand miles
[00:39.87]Everybody wore a quiet face
[00:42.31]Like somebody had erased their smiles
[00:48.57]I tried to throw a little light
[00:50.07]Made a joke and watched it fly
[00:52.100]Someone took it the wrong way
[00:54.87]So I swallowed mine
[00:56.89]And I wondered
[00:57.98]When did laughter become dangerous?
[01:00.09]When did kindness need a reason?
[01:02.37]When did every little moment
[01:03.46]Need a number, name, or season?
[01:06.43]We're running faster than before
[01:08.94]But what are we running for?
[01:11.26]Everybody's got a voice
[01:13.33]But nobody hears the noise
[01:16.80]Hear the noise
[01:18.66]Hear the noise
[01:22.91]Are we still here?
[01:24.47]Are we still feeling?
[01:26.39]Are we still laughing
[01:28.48]When nobody's keeping score?
[01:31.33]Are we still here?
[01:33.14]Are we still dreaming?
[01:34.95]Or did we trade our hearts
[01:37.17]For something shining on a screen?
[01:39.51]I don't want another world
[01:43.62]That only knows how to consume
[01:48.22]I want to see a human face
[01:52.40]Light up an empty room
[01:55.57]Hey!
[01:57.52]Put your hands down
[01:59.23]Hey!
[01:59.100]Look around
[02:01.66]Hey!
[02:02.31]There's a world outside
[02:04.44]Hey!
[02:05.03]We're still alive
[02:07.72]A headline says the bridge came down
[02:09.37]Another tells me someone's gone
[02:11.83]Another turns a human life
[02:13.74]Into something to move along
[02:16.31]A number flashes on the screen
[02:18.13]Then another story takes its place
[02:20.50]But somewhere there's a mother
[02:22.71]Still remembering a face
[02:25.03]Don't tell me it's just a headline
[02:27.31]Don't tell me it's just a number
[02:29.57]There's a person underneath it
[02:31.82]There's a heartbeat underneath it
[02:33.84]And somewhere underneath the noise
[02:36.44]There's still a human voice
[02:38.71]Not selling anything
[02:40.14]Not asking for a thing
[02:42.01]Just saying
[02:44.87]I'm here
[02:45.68]Are we still here?
[02:47.38]Are we still feeling?
[02:48.97]Are we still crying
[02:51.08]Without pretending we're okay?
[02:54.01]Are we still here?
[02:56.06]Are we still healing?
[02:57.69]Can we remember
[02:59.49]How to look somebody in the face?
[03:02.01]I don't want another world
[03:06.35]Where every moment has a price
[03:10.92]I want to see a human being
[03:15.25]Choose kindness without advice
[03:21.65]Maybe we're not broken
[03:23.69]Maybe we're tired
[03:25.32]Maybe underneath the noise
[03:27.20]There's still a little fire
[03:29.53]Maybe the child we used to be
[03:31.65]Didn't disappear
[03:33.87]Maybe he's standing at the window
[03:35.90]Asking
[03:37.13]Are you still here?
[03:47.04]I am
[03:48.57]I am
[03:50.95]I'm still here
[03:56.45]Don't scroll
[03:57.01]Look up
[03:57.59]Don't run
[03:58.13]Stay
[03:59.63]Call somebody
[03:59.89]Say their name
[04:01.34]Make something
[04:02.39]Make a mistake
[04:03.64]Laugh too loud
[04:05.36]Dance badly
[04:06.95]Tell somebody you love them
[04:09.14]Leave something beautiful behind
[04:12.35]We're still here
[04:17.20]We're still here
[04:21.49]We're still here
[04:30.20]Are we still here?
[04:31.81]Are we still feeling?
[04:34.12]Are we still human
[04:36.21]When nobody's watching us?
[04:38.76]Are we still here?
[04:40.51]Are we still dreaming?
[04:42.78]Can we build a world
[04:43.96]That doesn't need to break us
[04:46.31]Just to make us feel alive?
[04:48.89]I don't need another screen
[04:50.30]I don't need another lie
[04:52.86]I don't need another voice
[04:54.31]Telling me what I should like
[04:56.46]Give me one honest moment
[04:59.09]Give me one open door
[05:01.28]Give me somebody laughing
[05:03.27]Like they haven't laughed before
[05:08.57]I saw somebody smile today
[05:13.73]I almost smiled back
[05:18.13]Maybe that's enough
[05:22.84]We're not gone
[05:26.45]We're just buried
[05:29.45]So dig
[05:30.92]Are we still here?
